  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Core Rulebook</i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grappling_101\" title=\"Grappling 101\">Grappling 101</a></i></p><p>You are skilled at Tripping <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grappled\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Grappled\">Grappled</a> foes.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> +1</p><p><b>Effect:</b> If you succeed on a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grappling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Grappling\">Grappling</a> attack and your opponent fails the opposed <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a> check, it falls <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Prone\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prone\">Prone</a> in its space and is no longer considered <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grappled\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Grappled\">Grappled</a>. A <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Prone\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prone\">Prone</a> opponent takes a -5 penalty on melee attack rolls. Melee attacks made against a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Prone\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prone\">Prone</a> target gain a +5 bonus, while ranged attack made against a prone target take a -5 penalty.</p><p><b>Special:</b> You cannot use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pin\" title=\"Pin\">Pin</a> and Trip Feats in the same round.</p>",
